325 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (We hope that our project will play an essential role in sentencing transparency, and supporting fairer judicial decisions using the information we visualized. The goal of this project is to identify unjust sentences, particularly cases where the individual receives harsher sentences for low-level offenses. The project can assist prosecutors, policymakers, researchers, and advocates in the justice system by providing visualizations. Our visualizations will highlight the harsh sentences given under this law, show biases in incarceration, and make the large and complicated data more accessible for the general public.)
/E (We hope that our project will play an essential role in sentencing transparency, and supporting fairer judicial decisions using the information we visualized. The goal of this project is to identify unjust sentences, particularly cases where the individual receives harsher sentences for low-level offenses. The project can assist prosecutors, policymakers, researchers, and advocates in the justice system by providing visualizations. Our visualizations will highlight the harsh sentences given under this law, show biases in incarceration, and make the large and complicated data more accessible for the general public.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
