528 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (10.1 What We Learned About the Data: We first noticed that our dataset has couple of issues and needed lot of cleaning. For instance, some of our entries were too high, missing, duplicated. There were also numerous columns that was not useful to our analysis so we drop the columns. We ended up finding another dataset that will help determine the minority. We also fix the formatting so the data will reflect to the California sentencing. )
/E (10.1 What We Learned About the Data: We first noticed that our dataset has couple of issues and needed lot of cleaning. For instance, some of our entries were too high, missing, duplicated. There were also numerous columns that was not useful to our analysis so we drop the columns. We ended up finding another dataset that will help determine the minority. We also fix the formatting so the data will reflect to the California sentencing. )
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
